{"scene_id": "s02465", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s02465.fountain", "heading": "INT. HOTEL BALLROOM - ARBITRATION HEARING - DAY", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "PRUDENCE OKEKE-LINDGREN", "names": ["PRUDENCE OKEKE-LINDGREN", "PRUDENCE"], "gender": "f", "first": 4, "spoke": 25}, {"id": 1, "name": "GARRICK SOAMES", "names": ["GARRICK SOAMES", "GARRICK"], "gender": "m", "first": 5, "spoke": 23}, {"id": 2, "name": "ARBITRATOR", "names": ["ARBITRATOR"], "gender": "?", "first": 61, "spoke": 0}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. HOTEL BALLROOM - ARBITRATION HEARING - DAY", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A chandeliered ballroom pressed into service.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "A makeshift bench of two folding tables.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Through the folding partition, the thump of a wedding band warming up next door.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "PRUDENCE OKEKE-LINDGREN (40s, navy suit, steady, a legal pad crowded with her own handwriting) stands at a lectern.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Across the aisle, GARRICK SOAMES (50s, pinstripes, silver tie clip, a smile like a trap) sits sprawled, one ankle across his knee.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "The arbitrator's chair is empty; the arbitrator has gone to find a stapler.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Mr. Soames, while we wait.", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ms. Okeke-Lindgren, always a pleasure.", "name": "GARRICK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I wanted to ask about the Kowalski contract.", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I can't imagine what there is to ask.", "name": "GARRICK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Page nine. Clause fourteen.", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Boilerplate.", "name": "GARRICK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It says your client \"shall deliver all materials by the thirty-first.\"", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It does.", "name": "GARRICK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The thirty-first of what?", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Garrick's smile does not move.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "He straightens his tie clip.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I believe it's clear from context.", "name": "GARRICK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Is it? Because my client received a delivery on the first of the following month. And your client's position is that this was timely.", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It was timely.", "name": "GARRICK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "By one day.", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "By one day, yes.", "name": "GARRICK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Prudence opens her folder and lays a single sheet on the lectern, smoothing it flat with the heel of her hand.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Garrick watches her fingers, then the page, then her face.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "This is a calendar. Of the month in question.", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I don't need a calendar.", "name": "GARRICK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Humor me.", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "She slides it across the aisle.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Garrick does not touch it.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "She waits.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "The wedding band, next door, begins a slow waltz.", "para": 4, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "Garrick finally reaches for the page, holds it at arm's length, then draws it closer, reading the tiny numerals with growing attention.", "para": 4, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "There is no thirty-first.", "name": "GARRICK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "There is not.", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The month has thirty days.", "name": "GARRICK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It does.", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then the clause is ambiguous.", "name": "GARRICK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["carefully"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It is. And under the doctrine of contra proferentem, ambiguity is construed against the drafter.", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Which was my client.", "name": "GARRICK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Which was your client.", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "Garrick drops the calendar.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "It flutters to the carpet.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "He stands, buttons his jacket, and walks to the lectern in two long strides, his shadow falling across her pad.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Prudence.", "name": "GARRICK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Garrick.", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You've done your homework.", "name": "GARRICK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I always do.", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "What do you want?", "name": "GARRICK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Performance. Delivery of the materials, with interest, and costs.", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "My client will never agree.", "name": "GARRICK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then we will let the arbitrator decide, as we agreed to do.", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "The partition shakes as the wedding band crashes into its first full chorus.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "Garrick flinches.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Prudence does not.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "She gathers her pad, taps it into alignment, and sets it down.", "para": 6, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You have been planning this for months.", "name": "GARRICK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["low"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "For eleven weeks. I have been quiet.", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It is not like you.", "name": "GARRICK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's exactly like me.", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "A door opens at the far end.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "The ARBITRATOR is not seen, only the sound of a stapler on a folding table.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "Garrick glances over his shoulder, then back.", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 63, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Fifty thousand.", "name": "GARRICK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 64, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Eighty.", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 65, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Sixty.", "name": "GARRICK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 66, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Eighty-five. And you pay for the ballroom.", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 67, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Why would I pay for the ballroom?", "name": "GARRICK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 68, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Because the wedding next door is mine.", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "He stares.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "The band erupts into \"Congratulations.\"", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "Prudence smiles for the first time, small, private, and tilts her head toward the music.", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 72, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "My daughter's.", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "Garrick closes his eyes.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "His shoulders drop.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "When he opens them, he is almost laughing.", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 76, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Eighty-five.", "name": "GARRICK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 77, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Done.", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "She holds out her hand.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "He takes it.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "They shake, once, hard.", "para": 10, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 81, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You know you're insufferable.", "name": "GARRICK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 82, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And yet.", "name": "PRUDENCE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "She gathers her things and walks briskly toward the partition.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "Garrick watches her go, then stoops, picks up the calendar, and tucks it into his pocket like a trophy.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}]}